  "prefLabel": "Puc 2002.05 Customer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2002.05 “Customer” means any person or entity in this state, including any governmental unit, which purchases electricity at retail, and is the customer of record on the utility account.\n\nSource. #12372, eff 11-1-17 (from Puc 2002.06); ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.10)",
